{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"I know you might not want to hear it, but I think you could find what I have to say interesting. The Raven Queen is the Goddess of death, she is known for collecting the memories of mortals both lost to death and even still alive. But no one really knows why she does it. Some of us believe she does this because she acts as a filter. Pulls the fear, pain, and mortal baggage from souls in need, as a way to help them reach high planes of existence after death. I can't help but make the same connection with you. The Raven Queen stores memories in trickests, this is why I collect so many things. I've never seen her  work in this matter, but her methods are often very cryptic.  I'm not saying this is her doing but it does have her trademark. Memeories, pain, and death.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:14:28.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742324986408206367","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"He smiles, \"And the world is yet better because of it. It could be her I have to thank for helping my save so many lives\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:15:23.071000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742325215333449750","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"Lilia is a little surprised by his reation, \"Indeed. It would be interesting to see if there is more behind this. There is a reason her worship is a taboo.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:17:06.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742325649582194789","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"He moves onto another croissant, man these things are good. A little meat, mayo, lettuce, cheese.... oh man","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:17:22.439000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742325715998867459","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"Riga inelegantly takes the tablecloth after moving the wine and plate for a moment, then tosses it over the couch so he wouldn't get the cushions bloody by laying back.","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:18:38.468000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T10:19:01.595000Z","id":"742326034887737424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"Some believe she uses us as pawns in a game she plays with other Gods, others, such as myself believe she uses us to help complete tasks that will keep the multiverse in ballence.\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:19:01.149000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742326130018746432","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"She stops realizing that she mughtbe saying too much for him to understand at the moment.","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:19:34.537000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742326270058168341","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"You, my Lady. Think too much. Even if those thoughts happen to sound sadistically relevant to myself and lend themselves true the nature of the world as we know it...\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:20:56.641000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742326614427172974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"He trails off and takes a drink","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:21:06.218000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742326654596022272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739551475406995497","content":"\"In other words, you might have hit my situation right on the money\"","created_at":"2020-08-10T10:21:34.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742326773039104012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
